<title>UK: Sullom Voe Brent liftings almost double in week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe Brent liftings almost double in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loadings of Brent crude from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal rose to 762,735 tonnes in the week to November 5, up from 471,605 tonnes the previous week, the Shetland Islands Council Marine Operations Department said.</p>
<p>Four cargoes were destined for British refineries, two to German refineries and a VLCC to the U.S. Gulf.</p>
